    "skanlite;scan;scanner;scanning;sane;document;photo;copy;flatbed;all-in-one;printer;"

# guvcview ships as "guvcview" with the generic name "GTK+ UVC Viewer", which is
# four pieces of jargon for a switcher looking for the thing Windows calls
# Camera. The keywords carry "camera" and "webcam" because that is what gets
